. We went in there and started blowing. Oscar Pettiford was great to play with because we composed at least 3 tunes a night or more. He'd start a bass figure and I would play, and that is really my schtick, my whole way of doing. I like to compose while I'm playing. We had a great session going except then he was crazy ...", "type": "string"}, "datatype": "string"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q12917$A27D28AD-F11E-45B6-A917-3CB5F9DD91E5", "rank": "normal"}], "P20": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P20", "hash": "cba5754ff8db009fcf3ef279cbd33df49d0b9561", "datavalue": {"value": "https://semlab.s3.amazonaws.com/texts/7f2d6063335b48edf115ddc57d56bb92/729.txt", "type": "string"}, "datatype": "url"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q12917$FE00F28D-8444-44C4-B5AB-508E59BBFE33", "rank": "normal"}], "P21": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P21", "hash": "9289ccc7c3bcac1274a00808f8752fd72d4a76a1", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 1121, "id": "Q1121"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q12917$8A2E8F1D-6846-4D92-8F87-0045B410EF22", "rank": "normal"}, {"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P21", "hash": "3e1ebd22697498117f92afa52ac6f146cff711fb", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 248, "id": "Q248"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q12917$19D08E44-AF78-4876-A635-F83455D3E36B", "rank": "normal"}, {"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P21", "hash": "480672c30c8b438dd40f703adf7bf950ea8c0a50", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 13, "id": "Q13"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q12917$23288ABB-9716-4AF4-9DDE-09008771FE1F", "rank": "normal"}], "P22": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P22", "hash": "e1689792b7d4d5d7c5e1807ce858e4cb68703f04", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "it